 a milky way oh dear are you  serious yeah no he's not i am are you  really that's my breakfast are you  kidding me i kid you not why do i think  you're kidding  i don't know you're in really good shape  well yeah  even as he faced his death alex was  still so level-headed here's an  interview he gave last october to a  canadian television station  the thought of the pancreatic cancer  does not frighten me you're not afraid  of dying  no no not afraid of dying  as i told somebody the other day one  thing they're not going to  say at my funeral as a part of a eulogy  he was taken from us too soon  i'm 79 years old so hey i've lived a  good life a full life  alex trebek was a class act
 

